{"id":"wb-7-500","name":"达玛沟佛寺遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"达玛沟佛寺遗址","text":"达玛沟佛寺遗址位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区和田地区策勒县，由托普鲁克墩1号佛寺、托普鲁克墩2号佛寺、托普鲁克墩3号佛寺组成。其中托普鲁克墩1号佛寺是已发现最小的中古时期佛寺，始建于6至7世纪，为于阗国佛教遗迹。托普鲁克墩2号佛寺、托普鲁克墩3号佛寺时代可能为8世纪，佛寺可能是吐蕃人留下的遗迹。达玛沟佛寺遗址毁于喀喇汗王朝吞并于阗国，于阗改信伊斯兰教时。\n2013年，达玛沟佛寺遗址列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BE%BE%E7%8E%9B%E6%B2%9F%E4%BD%9B%E5%AF%BA%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92780659,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92780659","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ad5c6c578be9f262ad58a38f.png","title":"达玛沟佛寺遗址布局示意图.png","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%BE%BE%E7%8E%9B%E6%B2%9F%E4%BD%9B%E5%AF%BA%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%B8%83%E5%B1%80%E7%A4%BA%E6%84%8F%E5%9B%BE.png","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/00/%E8%BE%BE%E7%8E%9B%E6%B2%9F%E4%BD%9B%E5%AF%BA%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80%E5%B8%83%E5%B1%80%E7%A4%BA%E6%84%8F%E5%9B%BE.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​达玛沟佛寺遗址布局示意图","width":320,"height":232,"subject":"达玛沟佛寺遗址布局示意图","matchEvidence":"核对明确标注文物名称的布局图及对应遗址相册"}}